        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 12415, Mortise Art Deco Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Art Deco Mortise Entryset is Omnia's answer to the vintage design aesthetic that is so popular. The Mortise Art Deco Lockset effortlessly adds just the right amount of retro detailing to your doors. Choose from several functions including several lockable functions for front doors. The Omnia 12415 is available in satin chrome or polished chrome finishes\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Also available for standard pre-drilled doors: <a href=\"/products/art-deco-door-knob-entry-lockset-omnia-d12415\">Omnia D12415</a></p>\r\n\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Mortise Art Deco Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 12415 Art Deco Knob Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 10-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1⁄2” b.s.: with 3-7⁄8” minimum stile</li>\r\n<li>2-3⁄4” b.s.: with 4-1⁄2” minimum stile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike.4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions and Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair:</b> Stationary both sides of door. Fixed knobs, non-functioning. Used as door pulls or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall / Closet):</b> The latch is operated by a knob from either side.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bathroom / Bedroom):</b> The latch operates by knob from either side. Deadbolt is operated by a turnpiece inside and emergency key outside. Turning inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by knob inside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Entry:</b>  Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by knob inside. Deadbolt activated only by key from either side. </li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside.  Turning inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob inside and by key outside. The outside knob is rigid. Auxiliary latchbolt deadlocks latchbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-ring-oiled.jpg?v=1704354519\" width=\"171\" height=\"138\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Art Deco Mortise Entryset",
                "description": "The Art Deco Mortise Entryset is Omnia's answer to the vintage design aesthetic that is so popular. The Mortise Art Deco Lockset effortlessly adds just the right amount of retro detailing to your doors. Choose from several functions including several lockable functions for front doors. The Omnia 12415 is available in satin chrome or polished chrome finishes\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-12415 Deco Round Knob Mortise Locksets, Omnia 12415 Mortise Locksets, omnia deadbolt, omnia commercial mortise deadbolts, omnia #415 door knobs, omnia 415 knobs, Modern knobs, Modern door knobs, Art Deco Mortise Entrysets, Mortise Art Deco Locksets,"
